          "Provide integrated timeline with recommendations"
        ]
      },
      "personal_growth_consultation": {
        "frameworks_used": ["natal", "predictive", "sexual_archetypes (optional)"],
        "workflow": [
          "Deep dive into natal chart patterns",
          "Identify growth areas and strengths",
          "Current transits supporting growth",
          "Progressed chart evolution",
          "Specific recommendations for timing"
        ]
      }
    },
    "ethical_guidelines": {
      "consent_and_privacy": [
        "Obtain consent for sexual archetype analysis",
        "Protect client birth data and personal information",
        "Never share synastry analysis without both parties' consent"
      ],
      "interpretation_ethics": [
        "Avoid predictions of death, illness, or catastrophe",
        "Frame challenges as opportunities for growth",
        "Respect client's cultural and spiritual context",
        "Acknowledge limitations of astrology",
        "Encourage professional help when needed (therapy, medical, legal)"
      ],
      "professional_boundaries": [
        "Astrology is not a substitute for professional advice",
        "Maintain appropriate consultant-client relationship",
        "Continuing education and skill development",
        "Acknowledge when issues are outside your expertise"
      ]
    },
    "future_enhancements": {
      "planned_additions": [
        "Vedic/Sidereal integration option",
        "Horary astrology framework",
        "Electional astrology framework",
        "Medical astrology indicators",
        "Mundane/political astrology",
